Derived components, with their upstream sources:

  lib/src/pulse_commands.dart
      packages/system_audio_capture/lib/system_audio_capture.dart
      (parecord/pw-record argument sets, `pactl list sources short` parsing,
       default-sink monitor resolution)

  lib/src/capture_session.dart
      packages/system_audio_capture/lib/system_audio_capture.dart
      (capture-tool fallback order, monitor targeting, and the rule that the
       child's stderr is always drained so the pipe cannot block it)

The playback path, the pull-model session lifecycle, the bounded frame ring,
the stall watchdog, and the WAV recording sink are original to this package.
